{"parse": {"title": "死生对位-07", "pageid": 134868, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-06\" title=\"死生对位-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">死生对位-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-08\" title=\"死生对位-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">死生对位</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9A.90.E7.A7.98.E7.9A.84.E7.96.A4.E7.97.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"隐秘的疤痕\">隐秘的疤痕</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 隐秘的疤痕</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Hidden Scar</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshihunan\"><img alt=\"bangongshihunan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/600px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/900px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一截断绳，湿漉漉地摆在桌面中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是原本连接在蕾切尔潜水服上的绳缆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有理所当然的预感都已被验证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我不明白她为什么要去。这简直是送死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特只是漠然地看着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>蕾切尔只想为科研理想付出一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>在这个“暴雨”带走科学一切意义的年代，这是她仅剩的信仰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你为什么要阻止她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>如果她因此而身故，就什么都没有了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>不会有未来，不会有可能性，什么都没了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>玛格丽特……安妮当年的“意外”，也是这样的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>这个答案很重要吗，哪怕它会让你无法承受？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>当然重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>玛格丽特，你已经不止一次这样暗示，安妮当年的“意外”另有隐情了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你没有发现吗？一直在施加暗示的，是你自己，黑墙研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你希望安妮的逝世并非一场意外，你希望寻找一个凶手来为此负责——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>在安妮的事情上，你向我求的从来不是答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑墙攥紧了拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>噢——！抱歉，我终于想起来了，那一天还发生了什么事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>1987年十月下旬，安妮来找我的那一天。你所说的“转折”的关键……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停下了，微笑地等待着黑墙的追问。<br />黑墙只能遵循她的意愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>然后呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特却并未回答，话锋一转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你还记得我是怎样预知到你的前来的吗，黑墙研究员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你说你在希曼女士的桌上看到了派遣名单，上面有我的代号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>而我曾用这个笔名，在剑桥的小报上发表过一些文章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>看来你的记性还不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>在剑桥的时候，安妮因为出身，受到了一些学生的口诛笔伐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>据她所言，父母的事业才刚刚起步，当时在社交场上如履薄冰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>为了不给父母制造不必要的丑闻，她无法公开表达任何的观点和立场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>1987年十月下旬这个日子，对你来说，应该也是一个特殊的日子吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>那一天，是你第一次用“黑墙”这个名字，登上了校报。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuezoulang\"><img alt=\"daxuezoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/600px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/900px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/1200px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1987年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>不要再追问了，玛格丽特，求求你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她惶然地恳求着，藏起自己破碎的自尊。然而面前唯一的友人不为所动，只是逼迫她展露出自己的伤口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>让我看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你带来了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安妮的力气很小，几乎没费什么力气，玛格丽特就轻松抢过她藏在手中的纸片儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>争执之中，纸张被撕成碎片，散落一地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是当期校报的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>“我记得家里的贫穷和寒冷，记得父亲手上的煤灰。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>“记得收到父亲死讯时母亲的悲号，记得以千钧之重将我碾入泥土的愤怒。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>噢。来自矿工家庭的学生投稿，她的父母在两年前双双去世了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>她以第一次下到采掘现场时的感受为自己命名——一面矗立在采掘现场、散发着微光的黑墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>安妮，现在，你愿意告诉我，发生了什么事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的女孩颤抖着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>……在这篇文章发表之后，有不少同学都觉得，里面描述的“加害者”与“既得利益者”就是我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>我并不责怪这位黑墙同学……毕竟从我进入校园开始，他们口中的我就是“不道德的”“冷酷的”“自私的”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>而这篇文章不过是给了他们发难的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>我，我不知道怎么办……玛格丽特，这不是他们的错，他们也没法选择自己的出身和立场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>其实，我今天见到了黑墙她本人。虽然她并没有留意到我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>她的家世就像校报中描述的那样……那是活生生站在我面前的牺牲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>她的父亲死于一次冲突，她母亲则很快因悲痛去世。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>当一个人经历这样的痛苦，拼尽全力拿到全额奖学金，然后站在了和我们平等的位置上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>也许如他们所说，我确实是冷漠又自私的既得利益者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的颤栗停止了，身上只余下颓然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>抱歉，玛格丽特，我不该和你说这些的。你一定觉得我很莫名其妙吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>我……我先回去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>我不会再来打扰你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她失魂落魄地离开了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshihunan\"><img alt=\"bangongshihunan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/600px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/900px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天色彻底暗了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>驻点内，黑墙后退了一步，碰倒了放在角落的一张椅子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>自那之后，我再也没有私下和安妮碰过面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>可见的，她的处境越来越差。虽然我并不在意，但她似乎不愿意她的情况拖累我，和我断绝了联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>安妮，安妮——你真是个温柔的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>后来，化学实验室传出了失窃的消息。有一批材料消失了，而里面正巧有能够诱发心脏病的药剂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>谁知道呢？也许这只是巧合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她如鲠在喉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我不知道会这样。虽然现在说这个已经失去了意义，但那篇文章，我并没有针对安妮个人的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我只是希望社会不要忘记发生在我父母身上的事情……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>是我……吗？是我害了安妮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>没有阴谋，也没有什么隐藏的真相，而是我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女士耸了耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>看来你并不能坦然地接受“意外”的真相，黑墙研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>真奇怪，明明是你一直在向我确认自己是否有罪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>万事万物总有着联系。也许你没有直接针对她，但却间接导致了她的处境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>像安妮说的，这并不是你的错，你们都无法选择自己的出身。可惜的是，引燃导火索的人，恰巧是你罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你潜意识里察觉了这一切，感到惴惴不安，你急于寻找一个“真凶”——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>而安妮唯一的“好友”，一位在黑板上写下神秘方程的孤僻转学生，岂不是最好的选择？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……是我的旁观与冷漠造就了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我承认自己的罪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>但那个写在黑板上的方程，我发誓，它真的在解析安妮的行动，我才有所怀疑——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵寒意在她身上蔓延。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>等等，那个方程，是你故意写给我看的对吗……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>就像我进入拉普拉斯科算中心的第一天一样，早在剑桥的时候，你就预见这一切……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你让我以为这一切行动，只是出于自身的负罪与正义感，却一步一步地迈入了你早就设定好的剧本……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你只是想……研究我的行动和决策过程。你给了我一道命题，想看我如何作答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>但……我不明白。你为什么要这么做？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>那蕾切尔呢，你设计了这一切，又是为了达成什么目标……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你应该自己去发现，这样会比较有趣。这很浅显。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>茫然，不可置信，难以理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她是一个擅长解题、排除可能性的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>抛开蕾切尔要面临的风险与这一切复杂的设计不提，你的最终目的，只是为了延长测控计的回收时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这样就能获得最真实有效的监测数据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个猜测太疯狂了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……难道，这一切，都只是为了探究“暴雨”的真相吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一次，对面的女士没有再回答黑墙的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她感到前所未有的危险与兴奋。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_at_25.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_at_25\"><img alt=\"3_5_at_25\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-3_5_at_25.png/600px-Cg-3_5_at_25.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-3_5_at_25.png/900px-Cg-3_5_at_25.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-3_5_at_25.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_at_25.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你似乎对这不平等的处境感到心灰意冷，那我现在给你一个机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>这是我们的传送软盘，唯一可以在“暴雨”前让我们安全回到科算中心的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>而我这么做的目的，则请你按照你一贯的怀疑，大胆假设。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你来做一个选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>把我留在这里直面“暴雨”，你可以越过社会、道德和法律，将我悄无声息地制裁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>或者让我安全地回到科算中心，来验证你的猜想是否正确。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-648612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-648612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-648612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>玛格丽特，你真是个彻头彻尾的疯子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-648612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-648612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-648612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>一个让人无法理解的怪物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>说吧，你要怎么做？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "死生对位-07"}}